    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/d01587a1ba54b5f315d38ec5379c3e6f.avif?t=1754511501\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play as Hidalgo, the last free Bladewing, on a quest to save your corrupted friends and take down the twisted Crow Sorcerer, Omega Wing.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of Judanest is unraveling, poisoned by Meza, and broken by betrayal. You awaken after two years, bound to an eternal tree and armed with a demonic, talking blade that may be your only ally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/024cbdcee0310962f8214f134f5f342c.poster.avif?t=1754511501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/024cbdcee0310962f8214f134f5f342c.webm?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/024cbdcee0310962f8214f134f5f342c.mp4?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Industry Standard Platforming</strong> and Precision Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defeat hordes of deadly Tengu</strong> in fast-paced, skill-driven combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Elegant structured roguelite zones</strong> that test your reflexes and grit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Die, retry, grow stronger,</strong> and overcome impossible odds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Voice-acted cast</strong> and charming performances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Absorb Meza souls</strong> to unlock powerful upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wield the Yutameta scythe</strong> and strike from afar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose your weapon</strong> \u2013 Hammer, Blade, Whip, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fully animated opening cutscene</strong> sets the tone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Transform into the ULTIMATE Void Crow</strong> and demolish the Tengu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a vibrant world</strong> full of color and personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take flight and glide</strong> through challenging sky sections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect elemental powers</strong> \u2013 Flame, Lightning, and Poison</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A hybrid soundtrack</strong> mixing synthwave and JRPG influences!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-drawn pixel art</strong> with expressive animation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/cb3bdac8e99aa29b639501b9f99d5697.poster.avif?t=1754511501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/cb3bdac8e99aa29b639501b9f99d5697.webm?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/cb3bdac8e99aa29b639501b9f99d5697.mp4?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/af3db471df81c3fb2135f6998fec6789.poster.avif?t=1754511501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/af3db471df81c3fb2135f6998fec6789.webm?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/af3db471df81c3fb2135f6998fec6789.mp4?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic approach to video game storytelling, and an honest attempt at trying to answer the question of &quot;what if roguelites existed in 1991?&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense, precise, and rewarding platforming. Combine a variety of dashes, jumps, and sprints to reach your goal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Channel the power of the Mezameta Blade to seize corrupted souls from Tengu in the heat of combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smash Tengu with a devastating hammer, unleash massive damage with a brutal greatsword</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strike from a distance with a 'Vania-inspired whip, or hurl a deadly sickle for devastating ranged attacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/481f8ecd59e6f814b117a045100e6c53.poster.avif?t=1754511501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/481f8ecd59e6f814b117a045100e6c53.webm?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/481f8ecd59e6f814b117a045100e6c53.mp4?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a streamlined, yet minimal loop and persistent progression, every death brings you closer to victory. Fall in battle, and the phoenix at the Twilight Perch will revive you as a stronger Bladewing,  and more prepared for what\u2019s next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/46ad0dad5674df00c8451480864e276b.poster.avif?t=1754511501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/46ad0dad5674df00c8451480864e276b.webm?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/46ad0dad5674df00c8451480864e276b.mp4?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> One level might have you scouring ruins for keys, another navigating vast buildings while dodging patrolling enemies, and others will launch you into the open skies of Judanest for zen-like traversal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every zone brings something new, and every challenge pulls you deeper into the heart of Judanest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/4ab6aed1fc64f522a54545283b9cb5d9.poster.avif?t=1754511501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/4ab6aed1fc64f522a54545283b9cb5d9.webm?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/4ab6aed1fc64f522a54545283b9cb5d9.mp4?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/263c93490f48c718d9430db2aa444a0f.poster.avif?t=1754511501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/263c93490f48c718d9430db2aa444a0f.webm?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/263c93490f48c718d9430db2aa444a0f.mp4?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/2b4a134c59ca4c2ba87fbf592f645fb3.poster.avif?t=1754511501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/2b4a134c59ca4c2ba87fbf592f645fb3.webm?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/2b4a134c59ca4c2ba87fbf592f645fb3.mp4?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Take up arms against the evil Crow sorcerer who brainwashed your troupe.  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You must save them all.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/d01587a1ba54b5f315d38ec5379c3e6f.avif?t=1754511501\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play as Hidalgo, the last free Bladewing, on a quest to save your corrupted friends and take down the twisted Crow Sorcerer, Omega Wing.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of Judanest is unraveling, poisoned by Meza, and broken by betrayal. You awaken after two years, bound to an eternal tree and armed with a demonic, talking blade that may be your only ally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/024cbdcee0310962f8214f134f5f342c.poster.avif?t=1754511501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/024cbdcee0310962f8214f134f5f342c.webm?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/024cbdcee0310962f8214f134f5f342c.mp4?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Industry Standard Platforming</strong> and Precision Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defeat hordes of deadly Tengu</strong> in fast-paced, skill-driven combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Elegant structured roguelite zones</strong> that test your reflexes and grit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Die, retry, grow stronger,</strong> and overcome impossible odds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Voice-acted cast</strong> and charming performances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Absorb Meza souls</strong> to unlock powerful upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wield the Yutameta scythe</strong> and strike from afar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose your weapon</strong> \u2013 Hammer, Blade, Whip, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fully animated opening cutscene</strong> sets the tone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Transform into the ULTIMATE Void Crow</strong> and demolish the Tengu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a vibrant world</strong> full of color and personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take flight and glide</strong> through challenging sky sections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect elemental powers</strong> \u2013 Flame, Lightning, and Poison</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A hybrid soundtrack</strong> mixing synthwave and JRPG influences!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-drawn pixel art</strong> with expressive animation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/cb3bdac8e99aa29b639501b9f99d5697.poster.avif?t=1754511501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/cb3bdac8e99aa29b639501b9f99d5697.webm?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/cb3bdac8e99aa29b639501b9f99d5697.mp4?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/af3db471df81c3fb2135f6998fec6789.poster.avif?t=1754511501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/af3db471df81c3fb2135f6998fec6789.webm?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/af3db471df81c3fb2135f6998fec6789.mp4?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic approach to video game storytelling, and an honest attempt at trying to answer the question of &quot;what if roguelites existed in 1991?&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense, precise, and rewarding platforming. Combine a variety of dashes, jumps, and sprints to reach your goal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Channel the power of the Mezameta Blade to seize corrupted souls from Tengu in the heat of combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smash Tengu with a devastating hammer, unleash massive damage with a brutal greatsword</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strike from a distance with a 'Vania-inspired whip, or hurl a deadly sickle for devastating ranged attacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/481f8ecd59e6f814b117a045100e6c53.poster.avif?t=1754511501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/481f8ecd59e6f814b117a045100e6c53.webm?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/481f8ecd59e6f814b117a045100e6c53.mp4?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a streamlined, yet minimal loop and persistent progression, every death brings you closer to victory. Fall in battle, and the phoenix at the Twilight Perch will revive you as a stronger Bladewing,  and more prepared for what\u2019s next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/46ad0dad5674df00c8451480864e276b.poster.avif?t=1754511501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/46ad0dad5674df00c8451480864e276b.webm?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/46ad0dad5674df00c8451480864e276b.mp4?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> One level might have you scouring ruins for keys, another navigating vast buildings while dodging patrolling enemies, and others will launch you into the open skies of Judanest for zen-like traversal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every zone brings something new, and every challenge pulls you deeper into the heart of Judanest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/4ab6aed1fc64f522a54545283b9cb5d9.poster.avif?t=1754511501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/4ab6aed1fc64f522a54545283b9cb5d9.webm?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/4ab6aed1fc64f522a54545283b9cb5d9.mp4?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/263c93490f48c718d9430db2aa444a0f.poster.avif?t=1754511501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/263c93490f48c718d9430db2aa444a0f.webm?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/263c93490f48c718d9430db2aa444a0f.mp4?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/2b4a134c59ca4c2ba87fbf592f645fb3.poster.avif?t=1754511501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/2b4a134c59ca4c2ba87fbf592f645fb3.webm?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2228490/extras/2b4a134c59ca4c2ba87fbf592f645fb3.mp4?t=1754511501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Take up arms against the evil Crow sorcerer who brainwashed your troupe.  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You must save them all.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "You are Hidalgo Bladewing, a bird with a beef. Hack, slash, platform, and soar through a beautifully chaotic pixel-art neonscape in your quest to save your feathered friends. Structured roguelite elements, transforming weapons, and fowl Ninja action await.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cAtomic Owl is simply a good time, with fun combat and a harsh but also somehow fair roguelite loop that encourages repeated tries even after death.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 Xbox Tavern<br><br>\u201cIf you want a short, simple, and good looking roguelike then Atomic Owl is worth a go.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 The Sixth Axis<br><br>\u201cThis game delights not only with its gameplay but in making you chuckle, proving that sometimes, laughter is the most vital weapon against Tengu hordes.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Game Scanner<br>",
